          "id": 15,
          "start": 57.62,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "How it is working under the hood, it is using this WebSocket feature or this broadcasting feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 65.22,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "You can say broadcasting will not work without WebSocket.",
          "zh": ""
        },
